That type of writing was apparently just a phase for Fuller. Later in life
he didn't do it nearly as much.

And I disagree with his objection to "up" and "down". Those words can be
precisely defined as outward and inward relative to a center of gravity,
but outward and inward on their own don't share that center of gravity
component in their meanings.

stevo



